The standards and other cited works
The nutrient values in data/ are reported from three published standards:
- National Research Council (2006), Nutrient Requirements of Dogs and Cats;
- AAFCO (2026), Official Publication (Dog and Cat Food Nutrient Profiles);
- FEDIAF (September 2025), Nutritional Guidelines.
Each value cites its table or page. The notes also cite other works, for example Applied
Veterinary Clinical Nutrition, 2nd edition, and AAFCO's expert panel reports. These
publications belong to their publishers and are not reproduced here; read them for the full
text. Some notes quote, or closely report, a single sentence of a cited work, with its page,
where the exact wording carries the rule. That text remains its publisher's: CC0 does not
extend to it, or to any other right of the publishers. This project is not affiliated with,
or endorsed by, NRC, AAFCO or FEDIAF.

Status
The rules in this repository are the provisional steward's proposal, pending ratification
by a governance body. This is a non-normative reference implementation of the proposed
computation, not a ratified standard.
